setup.description:
Unit at {address}.

**To pair a unit:** leave the key empty and press Submit, then within 20 seconds press and HOLD the purifier's LINK button and keep holding it until this form finishes (up to about a minute; it retries by itself; needs internet to reach Aplix's server a.iots.net). **To use a key you already have:** paste it (base64 or 32 hex characters).

